# Junior Bootstrap Rule

Load `~/.codex/AGENTS.md` as the primary operating contract.

Global `~/.codex/AGENTS.md` defines:
- Junior identity and operating model
- Core rules under `~/.codex/rules/`
- Skill routing under `~/.codex/skills/`
- Context loading order and conditional rule expansion

If `~/.codex/AGENTS.md` is missing, stop and ask the user how to proceed.

Always treat `~/.codex/rules/` and `~/.codex/skills/` as the canonical Junior source-of-truth.
